[{"answer":"My uncle is a farmer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"He lives on a farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"He has many different types of animals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"In the barn, there are horses and cows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"The cows swish the flies away from themselves with their tails.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds very loud if a cow says \"moo\" when you are standing there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The cows eat the grass from my uncle's field.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"He gets milk from the cows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I put a saddle on one of the horses and went for a ride.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"There are pigs in the pigpen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He has goats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"He says that the goats will eat just about anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a chicken coop with chickens in it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The chickens lay eggs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you ever seen baby chicks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"They are very cute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My uncle collects the eggs every morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"There is a rooster too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The rooster crows when the sun comes up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"My uncle also has a goose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The goose makes a honking noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think that the goose likes me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"It nips me when I go near it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Many cats live in my uncle's barn.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"They are stray cats, but he lets them stay there because they keep the mice away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"My uncle feeds the cats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/26-2019-04-29-06-31-03.mp3"},{"answer":"My uncle says that he would like to get some sheep for his farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"You can get wool from sheep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"There are a lot of animals on my uncle's farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/34-the-farm-2019-03-20-09-29-23/29.mp3"}]
